```mermaid
graph TD
    B["Body Tissues"]
    VC["Vena Cava (Deoxygenated)"]
    RA["Right Atrium"]
    TV["Tricuspid Valve"]
    RV["Right Ventricle"]
    PA["Pulmonary Artery (to Lungs)"]
    L["Lungs (Gas Exchange)"]
    PV["Pulmonary Veins (Oxygenated)"]
    LA["Left Atrium"]
    MV["Mitral Valve (Bicuspid)"]
    LV["Left Ventricle"]
    AO["Aorta (to Body)"]

    B -- Deoxygenated Blood from Body --> VC
    VC -- Enters --> RA
    RA -- Through --> TV
    TV --> RV
    RV -- Pumps Deoxygenated Blood --> PA
    PA -- To --> L

    L -- Oxygenated Blood from Lungs --> PV
    PV -- Enters --> LA
    LA -- Through --> MV
    MV --> LV
    LV -- Pumps Oxygenated Blood --> AO
    AO -- To --> B
```